    "binding": "Canonical per-context cached native binding after original initializer completion; no alternate frontend",
    "owner": "JSClass reserved slots trace actual module/callback/dependency/binding/source edges; constructor reserved slot traces private binding owner, no finalizer-owned root cycle",
