    "moduleHooks": "Per-ShellContext dispatcher delegates non-owned records to previous real hooks; no process-global owner map",
    "source": "Actual UTF-16 compilation, positive offsets, source pragmas, ordered graph links/cycles and real namespace/live exports",
    "requests": "Retain complete parser attributes including unknown values; preserve original unsupported-key error",
    "callback": "Actual wrapper receiver, consume callback before JS call, first synthetic failure throws, later evaluation rejects original exception",
    "async": "Actual linked dependency traversal and engine TLA/Promise state; synchronous path rejects async graphs",
    "metadata": "Custom import.meta callback gets actual host id/meta/wrapper; default URL/path/resolve remains unsupported"
  },
